<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">[+]&nbsp;Open&nbsp;for&nbsp;crit</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>I want to give <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">this</span><span style="color: green">that</span> one a fat kick in the arse</p>
</blockquote>
<p>'fat' is&#8230;a strange modifier for 'kick' in english; I'd probably change it to either 'big' or just&#8230;leave it unmodified? Or change it to 'I want to kick that ones ass' so it's more of a general 'beat them up' vibe</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Way too many Gestalten</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I believe 'gestalts' would be the correct word here?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>You mean mentally, physically we are still separated.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>If they're physically separated, why are they all writing on the same page?</p>
<p>Like it'd make sense for a few of them to get together and write on the same page but there's like&#8230;20? of them?</p>
<hr />
<p>I'm a little torn on this as a whole; there's a lot of charm to it but it also kinda just feels like some low effort shitposts being thrown together to make an article; and part of me kinda wishes it did more with the concept of 'what if nobody was a hivemind' than this, y'know? Like if they started off shitposting and having fun and then gradually they all realised that this was a mistake and the arc shifted towards them trying to fix it; or perhaps if they just like&#8230;started to take it more seriously or something? Which like, the second page starts on but it feels like it might need to go further?</p>
<p>Then again, there's a part of me that sort of likes the idea of this being a like&#8230;collaborative log where folk can write little things from the perspective of being a nobody; though it feels like it'd quickly turn to a big shitposting spree and crash and burn if that happened so maybe not.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

